Add video_ucode.bin for the Amlogic S4 video decoder used by the
aml-vdec-drv driver. This is the initial release of the firmware, supporting
the S4 SoC.

The matching driver is currently under review on the linux-media
mailing list:

  https://lore.kernel.org/linux-amlogic/20261022-b4-s4-vdec-upstream-v12-0-616240978792@amlogic.com/

The firmware is submitted ahead of the driver so that it is available
in linux-firmware once the driver is merged.

Signed-off-by: zhentao.guo <zhentao.guo@amlogic.com>
---
 WHENCE                     |  11 +++++++++++
 amlogic/s4/video_ucode.bin | Bin 0 -> 97856 bytes
 2 files changed, 11 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 amlogic/s4/video_ucode.bin

